---
// Kostur web stranice koji se crta tankim brončanim linijama dok posjetitelj
// skrola (hero početne), a na kraju se popuni sadržajem. Upravlja ga scena.ts.
// data-zica = linija koja se iscrtava (redom kako se pojavljuju u kodu)
// data-puni = sadržaj koji se pojavi na kraju
---

<svg class="kostur" viewBox="0 0 800 560" aria-hidden="true" data-kostur>
  <defs>
    <linearGradient id="kostur-slika" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
      <stop offset="0" stop-color="#d9cfbf"></stop>
      <stop offset="0.62" stop-color="#b9ad99"></stop>
      <stop offset="0.62" stop-color="#1f7a80"></stop>
      <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0b2a3c"></stop>
    </linearGradient>
  </defs>

  <!-- Podloga stranice (popuni se) -->
  <rect data-puni class="kostur__podloga" x="10" y="10" width="780" height="540" rx="14"></rect>

  <!-- Okvir preglednika -->
  <rect data-zica x="10" y="10" width="780" height="540" rx="14" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <path data-zica d="M10 50 H790" pathLength="1"></path>
  <circle data-zica cx="36" cy="30" r="5" pathLength="1"></circle>
  <circle data-zica cx="54" cy="30" r="5" pathLength="1"></circle>
  <circle data-zica cx="72" cy="30" r="5" pathLength="1"></circle>
  <rect data-zica x="250" y="20" width="300" height="20" rx="10" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__url" x="400" y="34" text-anchor="middle">vasobrt.hr</text>

  <!-- Izbornik -->
  <rect data-zica x="50" y="76" width="96" height="22" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__logo" x="52" y="94">Vaš obrt</text>
  <path data-zica d="M420 87 H470 M495 87 H545 M570 87 H620" pathLength="1"></path>
  <rect data-zica x="650" y="72" width="100" height="30" rx="3" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <rect data-puni class="kostur__gumb" x="650" y="72" width="100" height="30" rx="3"></rect>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__gumb-tekst" x="700" y="92" text-anchor="middle">Kontakt</text>

  <!-- Naslov -->
  <rect data-zica x="50" y="146" width="360" height="34" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <rect data-zica x="50" y="190" width="300" height="34" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <rect data-zica x="50" y="234" width="250" height="34" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__naslov" x="50" y="174">Digitalni vjetar</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__naslov" x="50" y="218">u leđa</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__naslov kostur__naslov--kurziv" x="50" y="262">Vašem poslu.</text>

  <!-- Tekst -->
  <path data-zica d="M50 300 H390 M50 318 H370 M50 336 H300" pathLength="1"></path>

  <!-- Gumbi -->
  <rect data-zica x="50" y="366" width="150" height="40" rx="3" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <rect data-puni class="kostur__gumb" x="50" y="366" width="150" height="40" rx="3"></rect>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__gumb-tekst" x="125" y="391" text-anchor="middle">Zatražite ponudu</text>
  <path data-zica d="M226 392 H310" pathLength="1"></path>

  <!-- Slika u luku -->
  <path data-zica d="M470 420 V270 A130 130 0 0 1 730 270 V420 Z" pathLength="1"></path>
  <path data-puni class="kostur__slika" d="M470 420 V270 A130 130 0 0 1 730 270 V420 Z"></path>

  <!-- Traka s informacijama -->
  <rect data-zica x="50" y="458" width="210" height="60" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <rect data-zica x="290" y="458" width="210" height="60" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <rect data-zica x="530" y="458" width="220" height="60" rx="2" pathLength="1"></rect>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__mala" x="66" y="482">USLUGE</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__info" x="66" y="504">Sve na jednom mjestu</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__mala" x="306" y="482">NA MOBITELU</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__info" x="306" y="504">Pregledno na svakom ekranu</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__mala" x="546" y="482">KONTAKT</text>
  <text data-puni class="kostur__info" x="546" y="504">Jedan dodir do poziva</text>
</svg>
